WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.813
"Oh no!" said Detective Smith.

2
00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:19.921
"That monster will destroy the Metro City Convention Center!

3
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:26.430
We must . . . Rocket Girl?"

4
00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:30.147
Roxy landed in front of the Metro City Convention Center.

5
00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:32.445
The building's roof was gone.

6
00:00:32.445 --> 00:00:36.913
Broken glass and bricks were everywhere.

7
00:00:36.913 --> 00:00:40.095
People ran out of the building.

8
00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:44.115
"A monster ate my flowers!" cried a man.

9
00:00:44.115 --> 00:00:49.174
"Run for your lives!" shouted a woman carrying an empty flowerpot.

10
00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:52.157
Rooaarr!

11
00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:56.683
The ground shook.

12
00:00:56.683 --> 00:01:00.726
A shadow fell over the convention center.

13
00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:07.417
A huge monster stood up from behind the building.

14
00:01:07.417 --> 00:01:10.387
The monster had green scales and a long tail.

15
00:01:10.388 --> 00:01:13.242
It looked like a giant reptile.

16
00:01:13.242 --> 00:01:18.320
Roxy gulped. "The monster is bigger than I thought!"

17
00:01:18.321 --> 00:01:20.852
Rooaarr!

18
00:01:20.852 --> 00:01:25.523
The monster reached into the convention center.

19
00:01:25.523 --> 00:01:29.756
It pulled out a bunch of roses and ate them.

20
00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:33.992
The monster burped loudly.

21
00:01:33.992 --> 00:01:42.336
Then it turned and walked away from the convention center.

22
00:01:42.336 --> 00:01:47.656
The monster sniffed and pulled all the flowers out of a garden.

23
00:01:47.656 --> 00:01:51.678
Then it walked some more.

24
00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:56.147
"I have to stop that monster!" said Roxy.

25
00:01:56.147 --> 00:01:59.868
"It's headed for Mara's neighborhood!"

26
00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:02.773
Roxy shot after the monster.

27
00:02:02.773 --> 00:02:07.098
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams.

28
00:02:07.098 --> 00:02:11.637
The laser beams bounced off the monster.

29
00:02:11.638 --> 00:02:17.213
The monster spun around. Rooaarr!

30
00:02:17.213 --> 00:02:21.956
It batted Roxy, knocking her onto a roof.

31
00:02:21.956 --> 00:02:27.359
The monster walked some more, sniffing and eating flowers.

32
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.388
Jack, Terrell, and Mara looked up from Mara's backyard.

33
00:02:31.388 --> 00:02:33.951
"Whoa!" cried Jack.

34
00:02:33.951 --> 00:02:39.361
"It's a huge monster!" cried Terrell.

35
00:02:39.361 --> 00:02:42.517
Roxy flew after the monster.

36
00:02:42.517 --> 00:02:46.304
"My eye laser beams didn't work," she thought.

37
00:02:46.304 --> 00:02:49.284
"I need something else."

38
00:02:49.285 --> 00:02:51.205
She spotted a big water tank.

39
00:02:51.205 --> 00:02:56.074
She lifted it and shot toward the monster.

40
00:02:56.074 --> 00:03:00.322
"Look!" shouted Mara. "Rocket Girl!"

41
00:03:00.322 --> 00:03:02.812
Roxy threw the water tank at the monster.

42
00:03:02.812 --> 00:03:06.337
The tank burst open.

43
00:03:06.337 --> 00:03:09.638
Water dumped onto Mara, Jack, and Terrell.

44
00:03:09.638 --> 00:03:12.211
Rooaarr!

45
00:03:12.211 --> 00:03:14.273
"Uh-oh!" thought Roxy.

46
00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:17.010
"The monster is angry now!"

47
00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:21.142
The monster ran toward Roxy and batted her again.

48
00:03:21.142 --> 00:03:23.241
Roxy ducked out of the way.

49
00:03:23.241 --> 00:03:27.352
"Ha!" she said. "You can't . . . Whoa!"

50
00:03:27.352 --> 00:03:31.120
The monster whipped its tail, knocking Roxy far away.

51
00:03:31.121 --> 00:03:34.544
She landed with a crash on the other side of the city.

52
00:03:34.544 --> 00:03:37.556
Roxy quickly flew back to Mara's neighborhood.

53
00:03:37.556 --> 00:03:41.480
Now the monster was heading up into the mountains.

54
00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:46.771
Boom, boom, boom! A mountain shook.

55
00:03:46.771 --> 00:03:50.091
A boulder broke loose and started to roll.

56
00:03:50.091 --> 00:03:53.449
Then another boulder broke loose, and another.

57
00:03:53.449 --> 00:03:57.226
Soon lots of boulders were rolling fast down the mountain.

58
00:03:57.226 --> 00:04:00.854
They were headed right toward some buildings.

59
00:04:00.854 --> 00:04:03.090
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy.

60
00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:10.163
"Those boulders will smash into Metro City!"
